hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1432","Musa bin Ismail Al-Fazari told us, a partner told us, on the authority of Simak, on the authority of Jabir bin Samra, who said: “I witnessed the Eid with the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. peace be upon him, but he did not give the call to prayer and did not stand.”"
